{"id":"n37864-3-7","stage":3,"title":"늘어놓다 · 铺开","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37864-3-7-1","ko":"지저분해서 못 보겠으니 네 방에 늘어놓은 옷들 좀 치워라.","zh":"太脏乱，看不下去了，把你房里摊着的衣服收拾好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지저분해서","meaning":"脏兮兮，肮脏","explanation":"지저분하다：脏兮兮，肮脏；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"지저분하다","audio":"/audio/8db48a7863a37c7a29f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27948","senseId":"2","lemma":"지저분하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지저분해서","audio":"/audio/65fbea13fabc31f5e226.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（与后面的动词合用）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（完成动作）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"보겠으니","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보겠으니","audio":"/audio/4e4d274be8970d5382d4.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"방에","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방에","audio":"/audio/6744ad97e6c1288d41a3.mp3"}},{"text":"늘어놓은","meaning":"铺开，乱堆","explanation":"늘어놓다：铺开，乱堆；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"늘어놓다","audio":"/audio/3a491267fe7652159654.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37864","senseId":"3","lemma":"늘어놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늘어놓은","audio":"/audio/f545a215b2e919f9f99d.mp3"}},{"text":"옷들","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷들","audio":"/audio/034f3ccd3ee882ae7fa9.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"치워라.","meaning":"清扫，收起，归整","explanation":"치우다：清扫，收起，归整；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"치우다","audio":"/audio/2e26bfacf9dbdb051cd0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89815","senseId":"2","lemma":"치우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치워라","audio":"/audio/459a56b3a23121b79e16.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8db48a7863a37c7a","term":"지저분하다","zh":"脏兮兮，肮脏","audio":"/audio/8db48a7863a37c7a29f1.mp3","entryId":"27948","definition":"不干净且脏得让人讨厌。","pronunciation":["지저분하다"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（完成动作）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不能、没能（完成动作）","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"3a491267fe765215","term":"늘어놓다","zh":"铺开，乱堆","audio":"/audio/3a491267fe7652159654.mp3","entryId":"37864","definition":"到处放得杂乱。","pronunciation":["느러노타"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"2e26bfacf9dbdb05","term":"치우다","zh":"清扫，收起，归整","audio":"/audio/2e26bfacf9dbdb051cd0.mp3","entryId":"89815","definition":"打扫或整理。","pronunciation":["치우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/77cc6a9163f1534baaef.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37864-3-7-2","ko":"조금 이따가 치울게.","zh":"我待会儿收拾。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"조금","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}},{"text":"이따가","meaning":"稍后，回头","explanation":"이따가：稍后，回头。","readings":[{"term":"이따가","audio":"/audio/aa70e42e378d2fb672d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24813","senseId":"1","lemma":"이따가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이따가","audio":"/audio/aa70e42e378d2fb672d2.mp3"}},{"text":"치울게.","meaning":"清扫，收起，归整","explanation":"치우다：清扫，收起，归整；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"치우다","audio":"/audio/2e26bfacf9dbdb051cd0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89815","senseId":"2","lemma":"치우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치울게","audio":"/audio/3c97dab8d0329c7590e7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"aa70e42e378d2fb6","term":"이따가","zh":"稍后，回头","audio":"/audio/aa70e42e378d2fb672d2.mp3","entryId":"24813","definition":"过一会儿时间以后。","pronunciation":["이따가"]},{"id":"2e26bfacf9dbdb05","term":"치우다","zh":"清扫，收起，归整","audio":"/audio/2e26bfacf9dbdb051cd0.mp3","entryId":"89815","definition":"打扫或整理。","pronunciation":["치우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d5b849c118e7d53d9e49.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.902,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37864","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":98,"sequenceScore":2.6273,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我待会儿收拾。","太脏乱，看不下去了，把你房里摊着的衣服收拾好。","这所学校真小啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["太脏乱，看不下去了，把你房里摊着的衣服收拾好。","这所学校真小啊。","我待会儿收拾。"],"answer":2}]}
